==English==
[[File:Trifle-w.jpg|thumb|A raspberry trifle (1)]]

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|en|tewh₂}}
From {{inh|en|enm|trifle}}, {{m|enm|trifel}}, {{m|enm|triful}}, {{m|enm|trefle}}, {{m|enm|truyfle}}, {{m|enm|trufful}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|trufle||mockery}}, a byform of {{m|fro|trufe}}, {{m|fro|truffe||deception}}, of uncertain origin.

